# Frantic Strength has flash (CR 702.8a): Bot1 casts it during combat, after Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) blocks the attacking Grizzly Bears.
# The Bears become 4/4 with trample: they survive the Giant's 3 damage (CR 704.5g), assign it lethal damage (3, CR 702.19b) and trample
# the last 1 through to Bot2 (20 -> 19).

